# No agents on the repo

This repository must never show agent, bot, or AI co-author attribution on GitHub.

## Commits

- Never add `Co-authored-by:` trailers for Cursor, Copilot, Claude, ChatGPT, agents, bots, or similar.
- Never set commit author/committer to an agent identity.
- Never amend or rewrite history just to add AI attribution.
- Commit messages must look like ordinary human commits: subject + optional body only.

## Pull requests and GitHub

- Do not open PRs as a bot account or add agent reviewers as the primary author.
- Do not add “Generated by Cursor/agent” badges, footers, or marketing to README or PR bodies unless the user explicitly asks.

## Enforcement

Git hooks under `.githooks/` strip agent co-author trailers. Do not remove or bypass them (`--no-verify` is forbidden unless the user explicitly requests it).
